  "behavior": [
    "Recompute plan-bound risk, cost, budget, selection and exact intervention at every reached decision frontier.",
    "Require the complete planned trajectory roster and derive reached decision keys from recorded effects; no hardcoded trajectory or decision count.",
    "Reject missing, duplicate, nonfinite, nonnumeric, unplanned or mismatched decisions and checks.",
    "Keep inference lineage, mandatory host acceptance, source authenticity and scientific benefit as separate gates.",
    "Bind every optional and mandatory checker report to the exact goal, state version/frontier, property, checker, assumptions, valid verdict/reason, obligations and acceptance fields.",
    "Rebuild completed host control flow from ordered effects, selected checks, missing-ACK reconciliation, terminal retry and outcome label; never trust a declared early-stop frontier."
  ],
  "legacy_contract": "Exact verify1-mlx-ack-pilot-v1 scope declares intervention step2/budget1 and fixed_check at step3; any unrecognized scope/version fails closed.",
